                                                "sense_id": "a254746d-5b2c-319a-abac-c52038dac67e",
                                                "text": "On the other hand, the German university exhibits a system in which the university course is almost wholly special; the liberal and propædeutic studies are relegated to the grammar-school."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44064834-8a16-4ff7-b6ae-595fa0bcb9ad",
                                                "sense_id": "a254746d-5b2c-319a-abac-c52038dac67e",
                                                "text": "Students were not allowed to repeat the first propedeutic year more than once or to spend more than six years at universities; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "propaedeutic",
